  <item>
    <title>VOL.13 从悦纳自己的身体到循证医学的尽头</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/654a4b9a505e127e6fe16031</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">654a4b9a505e127e6fe16031</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 07 Nov 2023 14:37:14 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>好久不见，在消失的这段时间中菜花解锁了新身份，实现了人生大跳级，解锁了更加丰富的日常，但阅读还是会继续。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这期带来了我们最近阅读的比较推荐的书籍，欢迎收听~</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期书单】</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>《身体由我》[德]希拉.德利兹</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>《要命还是要灵魂》[美]安妮.法迪曼</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>《曾国藩传》张宏杰</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>【本期你可以听到这些】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="35">00:35</a> 聊聊新手妈妈的体验：痛并快乐着</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="348">05:48</a> 《身体由我》：温柔的科普，认识身体，接受ta，享受ta</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="935">15:35</a> 《要命还是要灵魂》：科学的尽头不是玄学而是莫向外求</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1895">31:35</a> 《曾国藩传》：由古观今，以史为镜</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期配乐：</span></p><span></span><p><span>孤身--徐秉龙</span></p>]]></description>
