    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这是一期拖延症患者们的读书推荐，没错，马上10月了，8月的读书分享姗姗来迟。分享虽然有些晚，好书永远不会晚！</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期分享人】</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>丁虫，辛苦剪辑的过期产品经理</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>潘仔，气氛制造担当的在职研发</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>菜花，组内最佳主持能力的策划</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>【推荐书籍】</span></p><span></span><p><span>潘仔：</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>《消失的13级台阶》[日]高野和明 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="23">00:23</a></span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>丁虫：</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>《闭经记》[日]伊藤比吕美 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="729">12:09</a></span></li><span>  </span><li><span>《平面国》[英]埃德温.A.艾勃特 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2414">40:14</a></span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>菜花：</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>《俗女养成记》江鹅 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1358">22:38</a></span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>其余提到的书：</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>《法治的细节》罗翔</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>《三体》刘慈欣</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>【本期你可以听到这些】</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="369">06:09</a> 从不同角度看待死刑</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1203">20:03</a> 我怎么就困在了一个男人的身体里？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1884">31:24</a> 小时候越“用力乖”，中年叛逆就来得越凶猛</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2103">35:03</a> 杜英哲事件，就算不是完美受害者也无需道歉</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2850">47:30</a> 一百多年过去了，这本书还可以内涵到当今社会</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>本期配乐：</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>《今年一定带你去看海》--PeaceHotel和平饭店</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>「名探偵コナン」メイン・テーマ~ヴォーカル・ヴァージョン--大野克夫</span></li><span></span></ul>]]></description>
